## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema50 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,50,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema100 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,100,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_H1,12,26,9,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- MACD recent cross: loop bars[1..5] to detect sign change
- SL: `iLowest(NULL,PERIOD_H1,MODE_LOW,5,1)` capped at 40 pips
- Partial exit: track open lots, close 50% at TP1 and move SL to BE via `OrderModify`
- TP2: monitor EMA(50) trail condition on each bar
- P3 sweeps: EMA periods (20/50 vs 50/100), MACD lookback (3/5/7 bars), TF (H1/H4/D1)

